# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Release board — personal maintainer tooling, not part of this project.
#
# The board is how I drive agents against this repo; it is not something a
# contributor needs or a published package should carry. Live ticket state also
# changes on every claim, so committing it would bury the real history anyway.
# Backups live outside the repo entirely, under
# ~/.local/state/claude-board/<project>/ — see ticket-store.mjs snapshot.
#
# The loop prompts that used to live here (RELEASE-PIPELINE.md, REVIEWER-LOOP.md)
# are now user-level skills: ~/.claude/skills/board-implement and board-review.
# Project-specific conventions they read live in BOARD-PROJECT.md, below.
#
# NOTE: .claude/release-board.html is ALREADY TRACKED (baa6024) — a dead export
# of the retired hosted board. Untrack with `git rm --cached` when convenient;
# it stays in history either way, as RELEASE-PIPELINE.md does.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/tickets/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/ticket-store.mjs
.claude/ticket-store.test.mjs
.claude/board-server.mjs
.claude/board-local.html
.claude/board.config.json
.claude/board-snapshot.json
.claude/BOARD.md
.claude/BOARD-PROJECT.md
.claude/RUNBOOK.md
.claude/RUNBOOK.html
.claude/release-board.html
